  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA with PCA and avgpool improves validation accuracy and F1 over singleprofile RNA, but it is unclear whether a more expressive transformer aggregation further helps. config_003 tests only the aggregation factor while keeping the same RNA encoder and profile setting, isolating the effect of aggregation. This is the best next experiment because it minimally extends the currently best configuration and reduces uncertainty about aggregation before adding new encoders or modalities."
